WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:02.591
Welcome to Kinesis.

2
00:00:02.641 --> 00:00:05.947
This is where you plan, record,
and understand your running.

3
00:00:07.247 --> 00:00:09.520
Start by adding your running shoes.

4
00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:13.236
Every result you record adds to
the mileage of the pair you wore.

5
00:00:14.536 --> 00:00:17.703
Next, create a cycle with
your goal and a target date.

6
00:00:17.753 --> 00:00:21.709
It can be a race or a personal
goal, like running ten kilometers.

7
00:00:21.759 --> 00:00:25.750
If you like, generate an AI plan
with the phases of your cycle.

8
00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:31.273
In Request Workouts, set the days,
times, and how long you can train.

9
00:00:31.323 --> 00:00:36.336
Kinesis prepares a weekly proposal, with
the forecast, for you to review and apply.

10
00:00:36.386 --> 00:00:40.029
Prefer to build your own plan?
You can also import a spreadsheet.

11
00:00:41.329 --> 00:00:43.520
Your workouts live in the calendar.

12
00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.981
If your week changes, just
drag a workout to another day.

13
00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:54.025
After your run, upload the FIT or ZIP file
from your watch, or enter the result manually.

14
00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:57.869
To complete the workout, rate your
perceived effort from one to five.

15
00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:02.452
With the result saved, ask
for a workout analysis.

16
00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:07.456
Your training memory brings your history
together and shows where each detail came from.

17
00:01:08.756 --> 00:01:10.437
You're all set to begin.

18
00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.599
Happy running!
